# Copy this file to xai-api-key.txt (same folder) and put your real key on its own line.
# Easiest: double-click set_xai_key.bat in the gallery folder and paste the key.
#
# Create a key: https://console.x.ai/team/default/api-keys
# Line should look like:
# xai-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
#
# Do NOT commit xai-api-key.txt. Restart start_server.bat after saving.
